# The lines of vrend.score that this GL driver reads differently, and only
# those: everything else must agree with it byte for byte.
#
# Pixel hashes only, and each has been looked at rather than assumed.
# Five of these are one gaussian drop shadow, drawn on five surfaces: a separable blur
# accumulates in a different order here and the last bits move. res=459 is the cursor arrow,
# three pixels of antialiased edge. Ink is unchanged on all six, so the same pixels are lit --
# what moved is the arithmetic, not the drawing.
#
# Recorded against: OpenGL ES 3.2 Mesa 26.1.8 (gles 32)
